 "_comment": [
  "Machine-readable summary of the per-type skills (.claude/skills/<type>/SKILL.md),",
  "read by scripts/prepare-run.py and scripts/validate-card.py. The skills stay the",
  "prose source; when a skill changes its leaves or axes, change this file in the same commit.",
  "family: the product type id (API attribute_family_id). measure: the live type's measure_type",
  "(mass | volume | count | null) — mirror only; the live type (reference/product-types.json) wins.",
  "leaves: every leaf a product of this type may be filed in (dual species = both).",
  "axes: option attributes that tell variants apart besides the net content (rule 9a) —",
  "the live type's option roles win. csv_category: CSV `Category` values.",
  "2026-09-30: `pricing` (fixed/per_kg) and the `product-weight` axis are gone (catalog model)."
